  "given_answer": "M=\\(\\pm 2\\)  n=\\(\\pm 3\\)   m+n=\\(\\pm 1或\\pm 5\\)",
  "answer": "M=\\(\\pm 2\\)  n=\\(\\pm 3\\)   m+n=\\(\\pm 1或\\pm 5\\)",
  "given_solution": "【详解】试题解析：\\(\\because \\left | { m } \\right |=2,\\therefore m=\\pm 2.\\)\n\\(\\because n=3,\\therefore n=\\pm 3.\\)\n当\\(m=2,n=3\\)时，\\(m+n=2+3=5.\\)\n当\\(m=2,n=-3\\)时，\\(m+n=2-3=-1.\\)\n当\\(m=-2,n=3\\)时，\\(m+n=-2+3=1.\\)\n当\\(m=-2,n=-3\\)时，\\(m+n=\\left ( { -2 } \\right )+\\left ( { -3 } \\right )=-5.\\)\n综上所述：\\(m+n=\\pm 1\\)或\\(\\pm 5.\\)",
